    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem green_31.variants.lower_eventually :\n    let ans := (answer(sorry) : ℕ → ℝ)\n    Filter.Tendsto (fun N ↦ ans N - Real.sqrt (N : ℝ)) atTop atTop ∧ -- Break the O(1) barrier\n    ∀ᶠ N in atTop, ans N ≤ F N",
